rs" (Deut 15:7, the prefix on the one itself) and "one of them / of his ribs" (a pronoun, a noun) are left.'), (466, '# ---- THE NUMBERS WALK 4b (2026-09-10): (12) the fraction of a measure, (13) the unit noun as one ----'), (469, 'if core == \'וחצי\' and seen and len(add) > k:              # (7) keeps precedence: "a cubit and a half OF THE cubit" continues the numeral'), (477, 'if \'/\' in core:                                              # 11b (28): the ratio אחד/N% from verse_words — "one of the N" = Fraction(1, N)'), (478, "out.append(Fraction(1, int(core.split('/')[1])))"), (492, 'add.append(1); seen = True; prev_unit = 0; last = w        # the unit noun as one; the phrase stays open for "and a half"'), (557, "elif w == 'וחצי' and seen and len(add) > k:              # (7) THE HALF (3b): 'and a half' right after a numeral — Exod 25:10 'two cubits and a half' = 2.5"), (1840, "assert_ink('Exod 12:29', []); w.marker('Exod 12:29', M['exodus'], value='at half of the night the LORD struck every firstborn — the night belongs to the fifteenth (the day boundary is the evening): the exodus day (12:41,")]
